{"MetricAlertDetectorHandler is defined as a subclass of StatefulDetectorHandler but is an empty class (pass) and does not implement any of the required abstract methods (build_occurrence_and_event_data, get_dedupe_value, get_group_key_values, counter_names), causing TypeError on instantiation": 0.9781250953674316, "evaluate() docstring incorrectly states it returns a list of DetectorEvaluationResult when it actually returns a dict mapping DetectorGroupKey to DetectorEvaluationResult": 0.5202897191047668, "No try/except/finally around handler.evaluate() or create_issue_occurrence_from_result() in process_detectors - if either raises an exception, handler.commit_state_updates() will never be called, causing loss of dedupe/state updates": 0.6612372398376465, "Breaking abstract API change: DetectorHandler.evaluate return type changed from list to dict, and new abstract method build_occurrence_and_event_data was added to StatefulDetectorHandler without implementing in existing subclasses": 0.9246188998222351, "produce_occurrence_to_kafka catches only KafkaException - ValueError from _prepare_occurrence_message or _prepare_status_change_message for malformed occurrence/event_data will propagate and crash the processing loop": 0.24480757117271423, "DB and Redis state commits in commit_state_updates can be partially applied - if crash occurs between _bulk_commit_detector_state() and _bulk_commit_redis_state(), creates inconsistency between persistent DB state and ephemeral Redis state used for deduplication and counters": 0.6930432319641113}